  "prefLabel": "Liq 208.04 License Denial Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 208.04 License Denial Hearings. License denial hearings shall be conducted under the provisions of Liq 205, with the exception that Liq 205.09, Liq 205.12, and Liq 205.20 (f)(1) and (2) shall not apply.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 200) #13992, eff 5-31-24",
